{'symbol': 'CMI', 'date': '2022-01-13 08:30:00', 'title': 'CUMMINS INC. NAMES CHRIS CLULOW, VICE PRESIDENT, INVESTOR RELATIONS AND LUTHER PETERS, VICE PRESIDENT, CORPORATE CONTROLLER', 'text': "COLUMBUS, IND.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TODAY, CUMMINS INC. (NYSE: CMI) ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS NAMED CHRIS CLULOW, VICE PRESIDENT, INVESTOR RELATIONS, AND LUTHER PETERS, VICE PRESIDENT, CORPORATE CONTROLLER, EFFECTIVE MARCH 1. CLULOW IS REPLACING JACK KIENZLER WHO MOVED TO CUMMINS FILTRATION ON JANUARY 1 AND PETERS IS TAKING CLULOW'S FORMER POSITION. “I AM THRILLED TO HAVE CHRIS AND LUTHER LEADING OUR GLOBAL FINANCE TEAMS IN THESE NEW ROLES,” SAID MARK SMITH, CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER. “CHRIS AND LUTHER"}